# SCX_MRA_HOW_v5.0

**Agent:** MRA (Metrics & Reporting Agent)
**Version:** 5.0
**Compiled:** Chat #103 · July 25, 2026
**Model:** Pure JavaScript — zero LLM calls, zero token cost
**Status:** Production-live, multi-client, three cadences. **Node count UNRECONCILED — see Known Discrepancies.**

---

## 1. Purpose

MRA generates scheduled intelligence reports for all active clients on three cadences:

- **Daily** — 24-hour review summary, 8am UTC
- **Weekly** — Monday intelligence brief, 9am UTC
- **Monthly** — 1st-of-month pattern report, 10am UTC

Zero AI calls. All computation is deterministic JS aggregation + HTML templating + one Brevo send per client per run.

**Architectural principle #1 (✅HIGH, unchanged v3.0→v5.0):** filters by ALA's guest-review posting date (`Date` field, M/D/YY), never by pipeline processing timestamp.

**Architectural principle #2 (✅HIGH):** single scheduled trigger fans out to all Client Config rows via a Loop Over Items pattern — one workflow run processes every client, not one workflow per client.

**Separate workflow note:** SCX-Sheet-Sync (5am UTC, its own dedup/append logic) shares NocoDB tables but has no execution dependency with MRA in either direction.

